      "title": "Price target decreased by 8.1% to ₹1,367",
      "body": "Down from ₹1,487, the current price target is an average from 13 analysts. New target price is 32% above last closing price of ₹1,036. Stock is down 9.1% over the past year. The company is forecast to post earnings per share of ₹63.79 for next year compared to ₹38.34 last year.",
